{"title":"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the reciprocals of the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/3/153d739cabfda6d0058d7333452825a48772812a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 + px + q = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" /> is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/6/fe641a14c62cb519eecc45c3c0e3d83d85790b34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -\\frac{p}{q} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{q}{p}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{p}{q}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ -\\frac{q}{p}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ pq$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"418\" height=\"36\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/3/223dbbdac3df5a00d1cba30319e57074e3d319bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x^2+px+q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"21\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b3bd7f12e0e499959c86139324da6e01c1ac6a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2f(\\tfrac1 x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"56\" height=\"23\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/9/999f318e2d80baa220e6d2697a683e3a99493267.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$qx^2+px+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" /> and has roots which are the reciprocals of those of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />. Thus, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a>, the sum of the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/3/7b3bd7f12e0e499959c86139324da6e01c1ac6a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2f(\\tfrac1 x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"56\" height=\"23\" /> (and thus the sum of the reciprocated roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/4/a84874dc1e3ce33862be44f27991d9733e244a0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{-p}{q}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"76\" height=\"52\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One approach is to plug in some values for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0eff6bcae29a2bb74df486cd88af86342ce6e96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-5x+6=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b022dc8ef6d33931fc1ae3d27df3ea0a81b52936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of the reciprocals of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1c901d28745fe7c2c8b3b469c46afb63fe66c08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"84\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>In this case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a526e44e36254c196af103613bc724f312b6a209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/3/673832328708b8704dba93d9024f7d4a75927800.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{-p}q}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"76\" height=\"52\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME\" title=\"1957 AHSME\">1957 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1957 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1957\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td wi